Hi Jordan,

The great part of MaAsLin2 is that you can either feed it raw count data and the default is that it will do TSS normalization for you or you can feed it normalized data and within the code put normalization = "NONE". The same goes for transforming the data the default is a LOG transformation, however you can also turn that off if you have already transformed the feature table before you run the model.

I hope that helps!
Kelsey

